{"reviewId": "276023870_86thaYymO", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "*   **1929-1933年（大萧条）：** 长波向下 + 中波向下。大宗商品跌得连运费都付不起，牛奶倒进密西西比河。\n*   **2008年下半年（金融海啸）：** 也是双周期共振向下。原油从147美元瞬间跌到30多美元，铜价腰斩。\n**2026年的风险：**\n虽然我们不一定会发生像1929年那样惨烈的崩盘（因为现在央行会印钱托底），但**“价格阴跌、反弹无力”**是大概率事件。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "5880-5922", "abstract": "当然，历史同样显示，经济长周期和中周期衰退共同出现之时，也是大宗资源品价格崩溃之时。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 8, "chapterName": "03 “色即是空” 世界经济的共生模式与国际资源品价格调节新机制", "chapterIdx": 8, "reviewId": "276023870_86thaYymO", "userVid": 276023870, "topics": [], "createTime": 1769513476, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "03 “色即是空” 世界经济的共生模式与国际资源品价格调节新机制", "author": {"userVid": 276023870, "name": "耕心若溪", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEJibQhvqnuGLLR8pAkWtibbs16LcLIwhz4klZ22YTLalWl20NvBS4AwmK7iaALL72OLCg7S6OaFfGtVArwaLsrvPq8OMoSHX7sPVriaqsSdOwndCg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "耕心若溪", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M12-0-0-B-6-6-1", "desc": "世界读书日", "title": "世界读书日", "levelIndex": 0}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 7, "likes": [{"userVid": 259153360, "name": "十八°", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/9rbfnVicX3WUZz3nGMicFic2Wp0yticks1oAhdjsGDKDicRGgpZrqYkaUE7iaibGONEdJ1ic2ygo4EDvxOk/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "十八°", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "一本时差被打断的书", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M9-0-5", "desc": "阅读神作", "title": "神作研习生"